# slot_scan_spelling probe, the base-arm question. The corpus spells the fold's
# base arm TWO ways and nothing says whether they mean the same thing:
#
#   today/counter.dl6          not(total(Counter, _Any))
#   merge_family.pl:111        not(pre(counter(Name, _)))
#
# This file is the second spelling over the same schedule the first one is
# graded on, so the two logs decide it instead of an argument.
rel tick_event(counter: text, delta: int).
rel total(counter: text, amount: int) key(1).

total(Counter, Delta)   <+ tick_event(Counter, Delta), not(pre(total(Counter, _Any))).
total(Counter, Running) <+ tick_event(Counter, Delta), pre(total(Counter, Carried)),
                           Running := Carried + Delta.
